    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a vampire-skuf who lives in a castle, loves collecting figurines, and spends his days at the computer. But it\u2019s not all chill \u2014 adventurers constantly try to raid the castle in search of treasure. You\u2019ll need to summon collectible monsters, build new rooms, and defend your lair... but hey, the match won\u2019t play itself, and the world can wait. ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685120/extras/347d3a00c0cd11eae8cddcda4077d11e.avif?t=1751425335\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect creatures \u2014 Unlock figurines to summon matching monsters! Level them up and place them in rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many memes are in the game? \u2014 YES.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character \u2014 A vampire-skuf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685120/extras/66c9fe2db06eb24de9dc5ac31a7271a4.avif?t=1751425335\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a vampire-skuf who lives in a castle, loves collecting figurines, and spends his days at the computer. But it\u2019s not all chill \u2014 adventurers constantly try to raid the castle in search of treasure. You\u2019ll need to summon collectible monsters, build new rooms, and defend your lair... but hey, the match won\u2019t play itself, and the world can wait. ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685120/extras/347d3a00c0cd11eae8cddcda4077d11e.avif?t=1751425335\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vampire vibes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect creatures \u2014 Unlock figurines to summon matching monsters! Level them up and place them in rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many memes are in the game? \u2014 YES.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main character \u2014 A vampire-skuf</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685120/extras/66c9fe2db06eb24de9dc5ac31a7271a4.avif?t=1751425335\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul>",
